{"words": [{"text": "وَأَقِيمُوا۟", "translation": "And establish"}, {"text": "ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ", "translation": "the prayer"}, {"text": "وَءَاتُوا۟", "translation": "and give"}, {"text": "ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ", "translation": "zakah"}, {"text": "وَٱرْكَعُوا۟", "translation": "and bow down"}, {"text": "مَعَ", "translation": "with"}, {"text": "ٱلرَّٰكِعِينَ", "translation": "those who bow down"}], "sahih": "And establish prayer and give zakāh1 and bow with those who bow [in worship and obedience]."}